      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "So that's working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "And we can also close that model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 7.98,
          "en": "because of the cancel link, which we added earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.98,
          "end": 10.291,
          "en": "However, for that modal, it would also be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.291,
          "end": 13.26,
          "en": "if we could close it by clicking on this backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.26,
          "end": 14.7,
          "en": "So on the background here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.7,
          "end": 16.86,
          "en": "that's a common pattern you typically have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.86,
          "end": 18.66,
          "en": "for these overlay dialogues.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.66,
          "end": 20.91,
          "en": "And at the moment here, it's not working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 23.31,
          "en": "Clicking on that background doesn't do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.15,
          "end": 26.31,
          "en": "Now to ensure that it does something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.31,
          "end": 29.25,
          "en": "we have to add a click listener to the backdrop, and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.25,
          "end": 31.95,
          "en": "that already is the case actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "In the modal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 35.4,
          "en": "on this div here, which is the backdrop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 37.92,
          "en": "there is a click listener on click",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.92,
          "end": 40.8,
          "en": "which actually triggers a function that's received",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.8,
          "end": 42.81,
          "en": "on the on close prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 42.81,
          "end": 44.58,
          "en": "So we expect to get an",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 44.58,
          "end": 47.91,
          "en": "on close prop on the modal, which holds the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 47.91,
          "end": 50.56,
          "en": "that should be triggered when we click that backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.63,
          "end": 54.75,
          "en": "Now we're using that modal in the add and idea routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.75,
          "end": 58.47,
          "en": "And the, here we must add this on close prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 61.05,
          "en": "But which kind of function should be executed here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.05,
          "end": 64.894,
          "en": "Well, a function that closes the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.894,
          "end": 67.02,
          "en": "How do we close the modal?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.02,
          "end": 70.02,
          "en": "Well, in the same way as we close this modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.02,
          "end": 72.81,
          "en": "when we click cancel, we navigate away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.81,
          "end": 76.41,
          "en": "That's what closing the modal means in this context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 79.02,
          "en": "Now here, however, we must execute a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.02,
          "end": 81.693,
          "en": "We're not navigating with a link component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.56,
          "end": 84.63,
          "en": "But thankfully in Remix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.63,
          "end": 87.66,
          "en": "we can also navigate programmatically if we need to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.66,
          "end": 89.73,
          "en": "in cases like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.73,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "We can add our close handler function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 97.02000000000001,
          "en": "as a nested function in the ad expenses page, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.02000000000001,
          "end": 99.21000000000001,
          "en": "and then point at that function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.21000000000001,
          "end": 104.19,
          "en": "So pass a pointer to that function as a value to on close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 108.06,
          "en": "And then here we wanna navigate programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.06,
          "end": 109.97999999999999,
          "en": "So not with a link component that's clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.97999999999999,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "but instead with some code that we execute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 116.7,
          "en": "And this can be done by using a special hook that's provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.7,
          "end": 120.81,
          "en": "by Remix, the use navigate hook, which is imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.81,
          "end": 122.763,
          "en": "from Remix Run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.62,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "This hook gives us a navigate function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 130.8,
          "en": "So this is a function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.8,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "which we can simply call like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 136.29,
          "en": "And then to this function, we can pass the path to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.29,
          "end": 137.493,
          "en": "which we wanna navigate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.42000000000002,
          "end": 141.48,
          "en": "So in my case here, I wanna navigate to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.48,
          "end": 142.74,
          "en": "the parent route again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.74,
          "end": 144.84,
          "en": "So we can use dot dot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 144.84,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "Just as before for the cancel link, there we had dot dot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 151.44,
          "en": "Now I'm using the same approach because we're",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.44,
          "end": 155.19,
          "en": "doing the same thing just programmatically triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.19,
          "end": 156.993,
          "en": "after clicking on that backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 158.01,
          "end": 160.39,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could of course also navigate to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.39,
          "end": 163.722,
          "en": "slash expenses like this in an absolute way, but I'll stick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.722,
          "end": 165.813,
          "en": "to the same logic as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.13,
          "end": 171.39,
          "en": "And now we can copy this and add it here in the dollar sign.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.39,
          "end": 174.32999999999998,
          "en": "ID file in the update expenses page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.32999999999998,
          "end": 176.1,
          "en": "And of course also add this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.1,
          "end": 179.463,
          "en": "use Navigate import from Remix run react.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.63,
          "end": 181.62,
          "en": "And on the modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 181.62,
          "end": 184.68,
          "en": "we of course also want to add the on close prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.68,
          "end": 187.683,
          "en": "and pass a close handler as a value to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.79,
          "end": 190.92,
          "en": "And if we do these things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 190.92,
          "end": 194.25,
          "en": "you will notice that if I click cancel, we closed this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 194.25,
          "end": 197.37,
          "en": "But also if I click on the backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.37,
          "end": 200.04,
          "en": "and of course also if we do that on the ad page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.04,
          "end": 203.52,
          "en": "if I click on the backdrop there, we leave that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.52,
          "end": 207,
          "en": "So this is now a nice way of closing that modal in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207,
          "end": 211.233,
          "en": "simply by navigating away, but now also programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
